daughter at home. He'd buy groceries after work and go home to make dinner, only to return to the office after Denise and their daughter were in bed. Mike had been looking forward to his weekend away, so his unexplained absence was highly unusual. Denise's father contacted the Florida Fish and Wildlife Conservation Commission. Known as the FWC, the organisation was the first point of contact when it came to managing the public waters and initiating search and rescue missions.
女儿在家里。他下班后会去买菜，回家做晚饭，然后在丹妮丝和女儿睡着后再回到办公室。迈克一直很期待这个周末的旅行，所以他莫名其妙的失踪非常反常。丹妮丝的父亲联系了佛罗里达州鱼类和野生动物保护委员会（FWC）。该组织是管理公共水域和启动搜救任务时的首要联系点。

