Unsure where to start the search for Mike Williams, a helicopter was ready to sweep over the area, but a cold snap in the weather forced the aircraft to wait until the conditions improved. In the meantime, FWC officers set out into the wilderness on foot. They failed to uncover Mike, his boat or his car. Deputies from the Jackson County Sheriff's Department were also brought in to assist, focusing on the areas Mike was known to hunt at in the past. Word quickly spread amongst Mike's friends and family that he had failed to return from his hunting trip.
由于不确定从哪里开始搜寻迈克·威廉姆斯，一架直升机准备在区域上空进行搜寻，但天气突然变冷，迫使飞机不得不等待条件好转。与此同时，FWC的官员徒步进入荒野。他们没能找到迈克、他的船或他的车。杰克逊县治安官办公室的副警长也被请来协助，重点搜寻迈克过去常去狩猎的区域。迈克失踪的消息很快在朋友和家人中传开，他没能从狩猎之旅中回来。

