00:06:24.000 --> 00:07:08.000
Their only source of warmth was a drumfire that served as the unofficial search headquarters. Brian Winchester had been Mike Williams' best friend since 9th grade. The two lived parallel lives, each marrying their high school sweethearts, buying their first homes and having children around at the same time. They remained close into adulthood, going on hunting trips together and planning double dates with their wives, who had also been friends since high school. So when Brian received word that Mike was missing, he didn't hesitate to join in the search.
他们唯一的取暖来源是一堆篝火，这成了非官方的搜救总部。布莱恩·温彻斯特（Brian Winchester）从9年级起就是迈克·威廉姆斯最好的朋友。两人过着平行的人生，都娶了高中时的恋人，买了第一套房子，并在同一时间有了孩子。他们成年后依然保持亲密，一起去打猎，并与他们的妻子（也是高中同学）计划双重约会。所以当布莱恩得知迈克失踪的消息时，他毫不犹豫地加入了搜寻。

11
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:53.000
At 2.30am, Brian and his father Marcus ventured around the western side of Lake Seminole. They reached an area colloquially known as Stump Lake, due to the many dead tree stumps that jutted out from the waters. They shone their flashlights through the reeds and trees, while calling out Mike's name. Marcus then noticed something in the water approximately 70 metres south of a boat ramp. It was Mike's boat. An FWC officer was notified and quickly secured the vessel. It contained all of Mike's hunting equipment, including his duck decoys, life jacket and
凌晨2点30分，布莱恩和他的父亲马库斯（Marcus）冒险绕到了塞米诺尔湖的西侧。他们到达了一个俗称“树桩湖”（Stump Lake）的区域，因为那里有许多枯树桩从水中伸出。他们用手电筒照过芦苇和树木，同时呼喊迈克的名字。马库斯随后注意到船坡道以南约70米处的水中有东西。那是迈克的船。一名FWC官员接到通知并迅速控制了船只。船里装有迈克所有的狩猎装备，包括他的鸭子诱饵、救生衣和

