shotgun. There was no sign of Mike or any indication that anything untoward had taken place. As Mike's shotgun was still in its case and there was no mud in the boat, it didn't appear as though he had been mid-hunt when he suddenly became separated from his watercraft. Mike's Ford Bronco was found roughly 70 metres away. Likewise, there was nothing in the vehicle to indicate Mike's whereabouts. The only possible clue lay in the boat. Although the motor was dead, the engine was switched to the on position.
猎枪。没有迈克的踪迹，也没有任何迹象表明发生了什么不测。由于迈克的猎枪还在枪套里，船里也没有泥土，看起来他并不像是在狩猎中途突然与船只分离。迈克的福特Bronco在约70米外被发现。同样，车里也没有任何线索表明迈克的下落。唯一的线索可能在船上。虽然马达熄火了，但引擎开关处于“开启”位置。

